    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KAUNA</strong> is a Finnish boomer shooter made with 90's retro style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you find yourself enjoying a peaceful summer evening at your cottage when suddenly a portal appears from the depths of the lake, ruining your plans. Now, instead of relaxing, you must deal with demonic forces that have invaded your cottage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> reclaim your evening and get back to enjoying that <strong>sauna</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the underworld and get rid of the demons who dare to disrupt your peaceful life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/b2a6af45fadb580983f9a75235cdb2db.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/b2a6af45fadb580983f9a75235cdb2db.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/b2a6af45fadb580983f9a75235cdb2db.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLAST YOUR ENEMIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/2bbb89de54540fc42125867cc10f52d3.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/2bbb89de54540fc42125867cc10f52d3.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/2bbb89de54540fc42125867cc10f52d3.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GATHER POWERUPS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/6d7aa03de1ed561ad46c871dae22b195.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/6d7aa03de1ed561ad46c871dae22b195.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/6d7aa03de1ed561ad46c871dae22b195.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save your cottage!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/d834c7426d74f6be8cd93a69b7b28ff4.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/d834c7426d74f6be8cd93a69b7b28ff4.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/d834c7426d74f6be8cd93a69b7b28ff4.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 90's FPS game. No cover, no reloading\u2014just pure shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, themed maps, each with secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional set of weapons are helping the fight such as a sword, shotgun and grenade launcher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>power ups</strong> to turn the odds in your favor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient and Metal soundtrack by Antti Kokko</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KAUNA</strong> is a Finnish boomer shooter made with 90's retro style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you find yourself enjoying a peaceful summer evening at your cottage when suddenly a portal appears from the depths of the lake, ruining your plans. Now, instead of relaxing, you must deal with demonic forces that have invaded your cottage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> reclaim your evening and get back to enjoying that <strong>sauna</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the underworld and get rid of the demons who dare to disrupt your peaceful life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/b2a6af45fadb580983f9a75235cdb2db.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/b2a6af45fadb580983f9a75235cdb2db.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/b2a6af45fadb580983f9a75235cdb2db.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLAST YOUR ENEMIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/2bbb89de54540fc42125867cc10f52d3.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/2bbb89de54540fc42125867cc10f52d3.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/2bbb89de54540fc42125867cc10f52d3.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GATHER POWERUPS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/6d7aa03de1ed561ad46c871dae22b195.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/6d7aa03de1ed561ad46c871dae22b195.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/6d7aa03de1ed561ad46c871dae22b195.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save your cottage!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/d834c7426d74f6be8cd93a69b7b28ff4.poster.avif?t=1755532706\" width=780 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/d834c7426d74f6be8cd93a69b7b28ff4.webm?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/extras/d834c7426d74f6be8cd93a69b7b28ff4.mp4?t=1755532706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 90's FPS game. No cover, no reloading\u2014just pure shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, themed maps, each with secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional set of weapons are helping the fight such as a sword, shotgun and grenade launcher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>power ups</strong> to turn the odds in your favor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient and Metal soundtrack by Antti Kokko</strong></p></li></ul>",
